  "title": "DynamicAnimation&Motion Sample Techniques (External Integration) [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "DynamicAnimation&Motion サンプル技（外部連携）【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "e77d1072599c328fd934d2dfa9087f81ad70a071dde46c798f2d9e4263e43520",
      "translation": "DynamicAnimation&Motion Sample Techniques (External Integration) [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "e77d1072599c328fd934d2dfa9087f81ad70a071dde46c798f2d9e4263e43520"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ツクールＭＺでの動作も確認済みです。",
      "sourceHash": "a6575f3b44071a03dee6d757b0b8686a1f8cf43fd12c157cbfa4cdf56d47dd3c",
      "translation": "※Operation with RPG Maker MZ has also been confirmed.",
      "contextHash": "a6575f3b44071a03dee6d757b0b8686a1f8cf43fd12c157cbfa4cdf56d47dd3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "外部のプラグインとの連携によるサンプル技を紹介していきます。",
      "sourceHash": "45663edb75b1613d4f2aeb24bd2cc84b81dee4d32fa7387cd551658af8273390",
      "translation": "I will introduce sample techniques that integrate with external plugins.",
      "contextHash": "45663edb75b1613d4f2aeb24bd2cc84b81dee4d32fa7387cd551658af8273390"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当たり前ですが、紹介先のプラグインをＤＬかつ適用しないと機能しません。",
      "sourceHash": "efe2c6d8d8aca9b138f83c636fde0a026c3e68425dfa0bcc55f7f3071881ce11",
      "translation": "Needless to say, they will not work unless you download and apply the plugins being introduced.",
      "contextHash": "efe2c6d8d8aca9b138f83c636fde0a026c3e68425dfa0bcc55f7f3071881ce11"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "暗転 DynamicMotion ver1.07（2020/06/07）",
      "sourceHash": "d4253e4263f6037e2a4a4c7900219a2b84be77b3d67f15bba2c7fa9341957104",
      "translation": "Fade to Black DynamicMotion ver1.07 (2020/06/07)",
      "contextHash": "d4253e4263f6037e2a4a4c7900219a2b84be77b3d67f15bba2c7fa9341957104"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 好きなように定義",
      "sourceHash": "97c49c6a0aa256fb1196a509f9692ac4f35fccf8fda285393335f12490091f45",
      "translation": "// Define as desired",
      "contextHash": "97c49c6a0aa256fb1196a509f9692ac4f35fccf8fda285393335f12490091f45"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// アニメーション終了を待って実行",
      "sourceHash": "eb68bd6b1c55e1a8905bbf98762921b6bda108bc43f0743ea4aeb93f2a80fb04",
      "translation": "// Execute after waiting for the animation to finish",
      "contextHash": "eb68bd6b1c55e1a8905bbf98762921b6bda108bc43f0743ea4aeb93f2a80fb04"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインの使用方法はリンク先を参照してください。",
      "sourceHash": "6c55884b5b5d523d7ff91893ec84a0aada5b30f965bd2e400a883edbe2f15ee0",
      "translation": "Please refer to the linked page for instructions on using the plugin.",
      "contextHash": "6c55884b5b5d523d7ff91893ec84a0aada5b30f965bd2e400a883edbe2f15ee0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "簡単に言うと、６つの数値は背景（下）の赤緑青、背景（上）の赤緑青の順になっています。",
      "sourceHash": "c98e5c76755e6cfaa6447a4513de32c8067a27e50fa10eccd4f6ad518a0ad340",
      "translation": "Simply put, the six values are the RGB values for the background (bottom), followed by the RGB values for the background (top).",
      "contextHash": "c98e5c76755e6cfaa6447a4513de32c8067a27e50fa10eccd4f6ad518a0ad340"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0だと黒、255だと変化なしですね。",
      "sourceHash": "33437e0709f13aa95a241ce342e7039734644338a0ba4594e77e7a4c61335ca9",
      "translation": "0 produces black, while 255 causes no change.",
      "contextHash": "33437e0709f13aa95a241ce342e7039734644338a0ba4594e77e7a4c61335ca9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※サンプルの記述はあくまで暗転部分だけです。中身は好きなように実装してください。",
      "sourceHash": "d8be54d7a790dfec8626623feb5f8648545d16c6768fee3fa483ff7a8b47e8b8",
      "translation": "※The sample code only covers the fade-to-black portion. Implement the rest however you like.",
      "contextHash": "d8be54d7a790dfec8626623feb5f8648545d16c6768fee3fa483ff7a8b47e8b8"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
