      "type": "line",
      "source": "このページは[[LINK_1]]DynamicAnimation[[/LINK_1]]および[[LINK_2]]DynamicMotion[[/LINK_2]]プラグインの解説の一部です。",
      "sourceHash": "d324b11043ca48cb9421137ed2e5aebc6c4b89f9906dee6b00306a1ec03ae2e6",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "このページは",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "DynamicAnimation",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "および",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "DynamicMotion",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "source": "プラグインの解説の一部です。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "This page is part of the documentation for the [[LINK_1]]DynamicAnimation[[/LINK_1]] and [[LINK_2]]DynamicMotion[[/LINK_2]] plugins.",
      "contextHash": "d324b11043ca48cb9421137ed2e5aebc6c4b89f9906dee6b00306a1ec03ae2e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "[[LINK_1]]暗転[[/LINK_1]]DynamicMotion ver1.07（2020/06/07）",
      "sourceHash": "917b67f438b8410e07435f60f89e73faf2d4e27a238a7d8296df76593cf6d0f5",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "暗転",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "DynamicMotion ver1.07（2020/06/07）",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "[[LINK_1]]Screen Darkening[[/LINK_1]] DynamicMotion ver1.07 (2020/06/07)",
      "contextHash": "917b67f438b8410e07435f60f89e73faf2d4e27a238a7d8296df76593cf6d0f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-003",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "村人Ａ様の[[LINK_1]]戦闘画面背景の色調変更プラグイン[[/LINK_1]]と連携し、背景の暗転演出を行います。通常の色調変更とは異なり、キャラやアニメーションの色調を維持します。",
      "sourceHash": "ce048a56ef8c6e0a803a79a9bc1476a3df1df4837a5d91391c59a69eb0993fe2",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "村人Ａ様の",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "戦闘画面背景の色調変更プラグイン",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "と連携し、背景の暗転演出を行います。通常の色調変更とは異なり、キャラやアニメーションの色調を維持します。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "This works with Villager A's [[LINK_1]]Battle Screen Background Tone Change Plugin[[/LINK_1]] to create a screen-darkening effect for the background. Unlike ordinary tone changes, the tones of characters and animations are preserved.",
      "contextHash": "ce048a56ef8c6e0a803a79a9bc1476a3df1df4837a5d91391c59a69eb0993fe2"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-004",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "※当サンプルでは[[LINK_1]]NRP_ParallaxesPlus.js[[/LINK_1]]で作成した遠景には対応していません。また時間の指定もできないため、瞬時に色調が変更されます。",
      "sourceHash": "0ff9fccfdc52b2f0f143182fdd35d68bba8916de4679dcc71700e6580b6dc4b7",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "※当サンプルでは",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "NRP_ParallaxesPlus.js",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "で作成した遠景には対応していません。また時間の指定もできないため、瞬時に色調が変更されます。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "※This sample does not support distant backgrounds created with [[LINK_1]]NRP_ParallaxesPlus.js[[/LINK_1]]. In addition, since no duration can be specified, the tone changes instantly.",
      "contextHash": "0ff9fccfdc52b2f0f143182fdd35d68bba8916de4679dcc71700e6580b6dc4b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-005",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "[[LINK_1]]改良版[[/LINK_1]]を作成しましたので、必要ならそちらのサンプルをご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "aed55b90dcb97679a3e041e7d3056e5c4b30e4e5402c5243a8f1c3e5eaf62c7f",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "改良版",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "を作成しましたので、必要ならそちらのサンプルをご覧ください。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "I have created an [[LINK_1]]improved version[[/LINK_1]], so please see that sample if needed.",
      "contextHash": "aed55b90dcb97679a3e041e7d3056e5c4b30e4e5402c5243a8f1c3e5eaf62c7f"
    },
    {
